  "details": "There seems to be an unexpected behavior regarding the accessory feature.\n\nSpecifically, for accessories that have been scaled down extremely using the accessory feature, the situation is as follows:\n\n- The accessory disappears from view depending on the viewing angle and distance.\n\n- However, it does not disappear from the user's own perspective, nor does it disappear when viewed through the user's own camera, even if the distance or angle is changed.\n\nIf possible, I would appreciate it if this behavior could be investigated.\n\nThank you very much.",
